# Pairs with ListedRestorable. Production before the fix of #5639: the delete
# learned of a lost lease only from its background renewal, which first ran a
# third of a lease in and swallowed failures. The scheduler's activation was
# lost - and its leases with it - a rebuild re-listed the whole backup, and the
# delete, still trusting its last confirmation, deleted the listed backup's
# artifacts.
MODULE: ListedRestorableArtifactsOnHeartbeat
TARGET: ListedRestorable
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a delete deletes artifacts on its last background confirmation of the lease
PERTURBS: DelArt

--- FIND
    /\ del[d] = "begun"
    /\ lease[d] = "live"
    /\ art' = IF gen = dgen[d] THEN FALSE ELSE art
--- REPLACE
    /\ del[d] = "begun"
    \* MUTATION: the caller acts on its last confirmation, not a fresh one.
    /\ seen[d] = "live"
    /\ art' = IF gen = dgen[d] THEN FALSE ELSE art
--- END
